rcial scale, isonicotinic acid, like other pyridine carboxylic acid is produced by ammoxidation of 4-picoline (4-methylpyridine) followed by hydrolysis of the resulting nitrile:\n\nNC5H4CH3  +  1.5 O2  +  NH3   →  NC5H4C≡N  +  3 H2O\nNC5H4C≡N  +  2 H2O    →  NC5H4CO2H  +  NH3\nIt is also produced by oxidation of 4-picoline with nitric acid.", "titolo": "Isonicotinic acid", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isonicotinic_acid"}, "wikipedia_titoli": {"en": "Isonicotinic acid"}}